523 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EDUCATION\nMaster of Human\055Computer Interaction\nB\056S\056 in Information Systems and Human\055Computer Interaction\054                               Minor in Film and Media Studies\n\nEXPERIENCE\nProduct Manager\054 State Government Client 2\nSince Jan\056 2026\054 worked with 3\053 product managers and designers within 50\053 person team to overhaul and enhance UI\057UX and feature sets of multiple internal\057 external healthcare web portals for a multi\055million dollar legacy system replacement\056\n\nProduct Manager\054 State Government Client 1\nFrom July 2024 to Dec\056 2025\054 led a cross\055functional team of 4\053 developers and testers on a \0441M effort to create data visualization dashboards\054 designed to facilitate high\055impact decisions by client leadership via clear and accurate reporting\056 \nLeveraged agile practices and stakeholder co\055design to deliver frequent releases\056\nSpearheaded major data availability and accuracy enhancements\054 including managing the rollout of a client\031s first data warehouse\054 newly implemented key metrics\054 and major visual and usability enhancements to aging legacy software\056\nTranslated client needs into enhancement designs for the digital modernization of legacy state benefits eligibility systems\054 web portals\054 and supporting databases\054  allowing thousands of recipients per year to access essential financial assistance\056\n\nUX Researcher\054 State Government Client 1\nConducted a usability study of the state\031s benefits eligibility system\054 which captured 100\053 pain points\054 24 major insights\054 28 user stories\054 and 5 central themes to drive 100 actionable recs\056 across 13 potential projects presented to leadership\056\n\nDeveloper\054 Designer\054 Researcher\054 and Videographer\nConducted user testing and derived insights around increasing benefits equity and accessibility in PA as part of a capstone project team of 5 graduate students\056 \n  \nPROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT\nMicrosoft Certified\072 Power BI Data Analyst Associate \050PL\055300\051\nCompeted in 12 Hackathons and received 9 sponsor and performance awards\nCMU First\055Year Orientation Staff\073 led 250\053 hours of training and events for 400\053 people\nFIRST Robotics Competition Team 4150\054 Vice President and Programming Lead \n\nSKILLS AND SOFTWARE PROFICIENCIES\nProduct Management\054 Human\055Centered Design\054 UI\057UX Design and Research\054       Client Relationship Management\054 Technical Communication\054 Agile Development\n\nFigma \050UI\057UX Design\054 Prototyping\051\054 SQL and Relational Database Design\054 \nMicrosoft Power BI and Data Visualization\054 Microsoft Office\054 Adobe Photoshop)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 524 0 R
     /Pg 495 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

